  "notes": "工单刷新与提现更稳妥。\n\n- 修复连续刷新工单或切换账号后，旧请求覆盖新列表的问题。\n- 提现申请或撤销后，即使已离开页面，也会刷新佣金余额和提现记录。\n- 切换账号后，旧账号的提现确认会失效，也不会再弹出旧请求的结果提示。\n",
  "notesEn": "More reliable ticket refreshes and withdrawals.\n\n- Older requests no longer overwrite the latest ticket list after repeated refreshes or an account switch.\n- Commission balances and withdrawal records now refresh after submitting or cancelling a withdrawal, even if you have left the page.\n- After switching accounts, earlier withdrawal confirmations cannot act on the new account, and late results from the old account no longer appear.\n",
